Implement LTX-2.3 model import

The aggregate_embed weights are written BF16 because the text feature
extractor runs BF16 and ccv_nnc_tensor_read cannot convert.

The q and k norm gains in LTX2.swift are now row-interleaved like their
projections. LoRAs never carry them, so the bug was latent. Un-interleaved
gains produce temporally frozen, washed-out video.
